WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.120
SCP-682 VS An Industrial-Grade Blender Followed
by Strong Centrifuge.

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:09.280
Could this, the most hardcore of industrial
kitchen equipment, finally take down the Hard

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:10.320
to Destroy Reptile?

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:15.520
A 682 tissue sample was reduced into a fine
slurry by the blender and then placed into

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:20.560
the centrifuge, which slowly increased to
a truly insane number of rotations per minute.

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:21.200
And…

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.920
The sample exploded, severely injuring twelve
members of personnel and almost killing Dr.

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:28.720
Carlson, one of the lead researchers on the
project.

00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:34.240
It turned out that SCP-682’s flesh contains
anti-matter, hence the violent chemical reaction

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:35.440
that transpired.

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:39.600
Naturally, further testing of this matter
was forbidden by the O5 Council, to reduce

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.720
the number of unnecessary explosions occurring
on site.

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:46.720
I guess we’ll never truly know the outcome
on this one huh?

